msgstr "👁️ 谓词"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1384 b07f3f0f2e624855994bfa7b16f89d07
msgid "You can find below all predicates available in this module."
msgstr "以下列出了此模块中所有可用的谓词。"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1388 75b5daabb5f646b28dbbe4a453fd7b62
msgid "Is Conductive"
msgstr "是否导电"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1390 0f93fa5c663c48d2b3659df2bda61444
msgid "**`bs.block:is_conductive`**"
msgstr "**`bs.block:is_conductive`**"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1392 edadd86dbb78440597d4fa75200d7c7c
msgid "Check if the block at the current location can conduct redstone. The conductivity can depend on block properties. For example, a slab block may only be conductive if it is a double slab."
msgstr "检查当前位置的方块是否能传导红石。导电性可能取决于方块属性。例如，台阶方块只有在双层台阶时才能导电。"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1398 931488c9b7a0414d8624a7fe49c3c25a
msgid "Is Powered"
msgstr "是否通电"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1400 c7a42e04adf64e62831faf6173e9c75a
msgid "**`bs.block:is_powered`**"
msgstr "**`bs.block:is_powered`**"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1402 d03bf8a974464a3bac2689c37141cdd6
msgid "Check if the block is [`conductive`](#is-conductive) and powered by redstone."
msgstr "检查方块是否 [`conductive`](#is-conductive) 并通电。"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1408 06ec82a8d37c4ffab6076948da425fe8
msgid "Is Spawnable"
msgstr "是否可生成"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1410 c0c9fc88749a401a90b3fb7854338b82
msgid "**`bs.block:is_spawnable`**"
msgstr "**`bs.block:is_spawnable`**"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1412 0d4418e702b74ac3bd44d18c8cbf8187
msgid "Check if the block at the current location can serve as a valid spawn surface. This does not consider light level and may depend on block properties. For example, a `slab` may be spawnable only if it is not a bottom slab."
msgstr "检查当前位置的方块是否可以作为有效的生成表面。这不考虑光照级别，可能取决于方块属性。例如，`slab` 只有在其不是下半砖时才可生成。"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1418 34f93e39aee1469abb26b11130b172e9
msgid "Is Strongly Powered"
msgstr "是否强充能"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1420 7191a2c8a56c4252bf81090fe1fa9aa7
msgid "**`bs.block:is_strongly_powered`**"
msgstr "**`bs.block:is_strongly_powered`**"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1422 1ed4ff177d74499e850e285d77b55270
msgid "Check if the block is [`conductive`](#is-conductive) and strongly powered by redstone."
msgstr "Check if the block is [`conductive`](#is-conductive) and strongly powered by redstone."

#: ../../modules/block.md 64edc973c3244189b96deddfff1ec6f4
msgid "What is Strongly Powered?"
msgstr "什么是强充能？"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1427 87725fd4427f4b6997ddc7b41809357f
msgid "A block is strongly powered when it can power adjacent redstone dust (including redstone dust on and beneath the block), in addition to activating adjacent mechanism component, and powering redstone repeaters and redstone comparators facing away from the block."
msgstr "当方块可以给相邻的红石粉（包括其上方和下方的红石粉）充能，并且可以激活相邻的机械组件、给背向方块的 Redstone Repeater 和 Redstone Comparator 充能时，该方块即被强充能。"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1429 8809fae4af6e45058095ba225b223fc5
msgid "A block becomes strongly powered by being powered by a redstone power component, a powered redstone repeater, or a powered redstone comparator."
msgstr "方块被红石电源元件、已充能的 Redstone Repeater 或已充能的 Redstone Comparator 充能后，即变为强充能状态。"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1436 5ebcd22c58374d308f3225fc0381d594
msgid "Is Weakly Powered"
msgstr "是否弱充能"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1438 118f546c27474e18989f70d931c222b5
msgid "**`bs.block:is_weakly_powered`**"
msgstr "**`bs.block:is_weakly_powered`**"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1440 3de6ed0c7693421f9047fad967f6d511
msgid "Check if the block is [`conductive`](#is-conductive) and weakly powered by redstone."
msgstr "Check if the block is [`conductive`](#is-conductive) and weakly powered by redstone."

#: ../../modules/block.md b10d3422adf84c848c412af696093d8a
msgid "What is Weakly Powered?"
msgstr "什么是弱充能？"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1445 8183532b2ddb49d98f5e21842e93a151
msgid "A block that is weakly powered cannot power adjacent redstone dust, but can still activate adjacent redstone mechanisms, and power redstone repeaters and redstone comparators facing away from the block."
msgstr "弱充能的方块不能给相邻红石粉充能，但仍能激活相邻红石机械，以及给背向方块的 Redstone Repeater 和 Redstone Comparator 充能。"

#: ../../modules/block.md:1447 305a719607bc4cdbbfeb03b9dc02a582
msgid "A block becomes weakly powered when it is powered only by redstone dust."
msgstr "当方块仅由红石粉充能时，它变为弱充能状态。"

